{
  "info": {
    "name": "Blog CMS API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the Blog CMS - A production-ready RESTful API with authentication, posts, comments, and advanced features.\n\n## Features\n- JWT Authentication\n- Role-Based Access Control\n- Post CRUD with Search & Filtering\n- Comment System with Nesting\n- Pagination & Sorting\n- Error Handling\n\n## Setup\n1. Start the API: `docker-compose up -d` or `npm run dev`\n2. Update the `baseUrl` variable below\n3. Run the \"Auth/Signup\" request to create a user\n4. The token will be automatically saved\n5. Use protected endpoints!\n\n## Base URLs\n- Development: http://localhost:3001\n- Docker: http://localhost:3000",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "postId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "commentId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
